SUMMARY:David Washington Celebration & Appreciation 🎶💙
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# David Washington Cele
 bration & Appreciation 🎶💙\n\nAs David Washington concludes his secon
 d tour as Music Director for the **Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**
 \, we come together to honor and celebrate the incredible gifts he has sha
 red with our community. ✨\nDavid’s warmth\, energy\, and boundless gen
 erosity have touched our hearts in so many ways. His music has lifted our 
 spirits\, enriched our lives\, and helped create countless beautiful momen
 ts together. 🎵💫\n\nWhile his official role as Music Director is comi
 ng to an end\, David will always be a cherished part of our Center and our
  community. ❤️\n\n🍽️ **Please join us for a Covered Dish Luncheon
 !**\n🎉 **When:** Sunday\, September 6\n⏰ **Time:** Immediately follow
 ing the 11 AM Sunday Celebration\n🥗 **What to Bring:** A favorite dish\
 , salad\, or dessert to share\n💖 **Why:** To celebrate David and expres
 s our deep gratitude for all he has given to our community\n\nLet’s gath
 er with **open hearts and full plates** to show David just how much he is 
 loved and appreciated! 🥰\n\nWe look forward to celebrating this wonderf
 ul man and musician together. 🎶🌟\n\n#DavidWashington #ThankYouDavid 
 #MusicDirector #CelebrationAndAppreciation #CenterForSpiritualLivingAshevi
 lle #CSLAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #SpiritualCommunity #Inspired
 Living #CommunityCelebration
