SUMMARY:✨RETURN TO YOURSELF — SOUND BATH✨
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**✨RETURN TO YOURSELF
  — SOUND BATH✨**\n*Pause. Breathe. Receive.*\n\nStep away from the bus
 yness of life and enter a space of deep rest\, soothing sound\, and gentle
  renewal. Allow the healing vibrations to wash over you\, quiet the mind\,
  soften the body\, and reconnect you with the stillness within. 💫\n\n
 🗓️ Sunday\, September 6th\n🕒 3:00 PM-4:00 PM\n📍 Center for Spir
 itual Living Asheville — The Sanctuary\n2 Science of Mind Way\n\nCome se
 ttle into the sounds and let yourself be held by the moment. 🌿✨\n\n
 💗 Sliding scale: $10–$20\n🧘‍♀️ Bring a yoga mat\, pillow\, b
 lanket\, eye mask\n🧣 Wear warm\, comfortable clothing\n⏰ Arrive \\*\\
 *15 minutes early\\*\\* to get settled and choose your spot.\n\n*✨ Give 
 yourself this time to pause\, restore\, and return to yourself.*\n\n#Sound
 Bath #SoundHealing #AshevilleNC #SelfCare #DeepRest #Meditation #EnergyHea
 ling #SerenitySoundHealing
