SUMMARY:🌟 Beyond Gender: Our Divine Heritage & Sri Rudram Mantra Recita
 l
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌟 Wed Nite Special
  - Beyond Gender: Our Divine Heritage**\n**& Sri Rudram Mantra Recital**\n
 \n🗓 Wednesday\, September 16\n🕡 6:30 PM\n💝 Value-Based Donation\n
 \nJoin us for an inspiring evening with Kenneth Douglas as he explores tim
 eless spiritual wisdom through an engaging presentation and a powerful man
 tra recital.\n\n**🌿 Beyond Gender: Our Divine Heritage**\nIn today's wo
 rld\, conversations about gender can often become divisive. Kenneth offers
  a fresh and deeply spiritual perspective by exploring the Divine Masculin
 e and Divine Feminine as sacred energies that exist within every person—
 not merely as identities\, but as universal principles that shape our live
 s.\n\n✨ Through a beautifully illustrated presentation\, you'll discover
 :\n🔹 A deeper understanding of Divine Masculine and Divine Feminine ene
 rgies\n🔹 How imbalance within these energies influences individuals and
  society\n🔹 A spiritual framework for healing\, harmony\, and inner cla
 rity\n🔹 Practical insights for living with greater balance and purpose\
 n\n**🕉 Sri Rudram Mantra Recital**\nExperience the profound vibration o
 f one of the world's most revered Vedic mantras.\nTraditionally chanted fo
 r protection\, purification\, and the removal of obstacles\, the Sri Rudra
 m is more than a performance—it's a spiritual discipline. Kenneth introd
 uces the mantra with thoughtful context before leading a live recital that
  invites peace\, presence\, and deep stillness.\n\n**🎶 During this sacr
 ed experience you'll enjoy:**\n🔸 A brief introduction to the meaning an
 d tradition of Sri Rudram\n🔸 The calming rhythm and repetition of this 
 ancient Vedic chant\n🔸 A space for quiet reflection and inner renewal\n
 🔸 An opportunity to experience sacred sound in community\n\n**👤 Abou
 t Kenneth Douglas**\nKenneth Douglas is a seasoned speaker\, content creat
 or\, and U.S. Marine veteran whose life journey spans global service\, spi
 ritual awakening\, mentoring\, music\, meditation\, fatherhood\, and commu
 nity leadership. Drawing from decades of lived experience\, he inspires ot
 hers to navigate life's challenges with greater clarity\, resilience\, and
  purpose.\nWhether you're curious about spiritual philosophy\, seeking gre
 ater inner balance\, or simply longing for an evening of meaningful reflec
 tion and sacred sound\, this promises to be a memorable and enriching expe
 rience.\nWe look forward to sharing this special evening with you! 💜\n\
 n#CSLAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #SpiritualCommunity #InspiredLiv
 ing #AncientWisdom #DivineMasculine #DivineFeminine #Meditation #Mantra #S
 riRudram #SoundHealing #Mindfulness #SpiritualGrowth #AshevilleEvents
